'''Calabash Nebula''' is the 16th stage in [[Cats of the Cosmos]]. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], [[Kung Fu Cat (Special Cat)|Kung Fu Cat]] becomes obtainable and the [[Lords of Destruction DRAGON EMPERORS (Gacha Event)|Lords of Destruction DRAGON EMPERORS]] banner is unlocked.

