==Strategy==
This stage is fairly similar to the previous in terms of difficulty, meaning [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Castaway Cat]] still trivializes it. Just send out Castaway, as well as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]] and [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Dragon Cat]] to win.

